      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::rubric_card::000::82c51610a5"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alloy combines lightweight characteristics with superior comprehensive performance.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::rubric_card::000::82c51610a5"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alloy's limited aluminum content reduces its overall density.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Aluminum promotes the formation of nanoscale L21 precipitates in this alloy.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::rubric_card::000::82c51610a5"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alloy has a ductile BCC matrix.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast and homogenized alloy already contains nanoscale L21 precipitates in a predominantly BCC matrix.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processing route comprises arc melting with repeated remelting, drop-casting, homogenization at approximately 1200 °C, and annealing at 700 °C.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::rubric_card::000::82c51610a5"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing at 700 °C precipitates the L21 phase.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::rubric_card::000::82c51610a5"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Compression testing is conducted from room temperature through 700 °C at controlled strain rates.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::rubric_card::000::82c51610a5"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The compression tests are conducted under laboratory air.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The L21 precipitates are 10–30 nm in size.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The L21 precipitates occupy approximately 43–44% of the alloy volume.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The BCC matrix is relatively soft compared with the L21 precipitates.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strengthening occurs through load transfer from the BCC matrix to hard L21 precipitates.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al20Cr5Fe50Mn20Ti5 can exceed 1000 MPa yield strength at 600 °C.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
